#: includes/class-rwtai-admin.php:146
msgid "When a post is published, this plugin sends its title, excerpt, author, date, first category, site name and site address to thirds.ai, which renders a 1200 by 630 PNG from a template. The PNG is added to the media library, used as the Open Graph image and, if you choose, set as the featured image. thirds.ai is a paid service and needs an account and API key."
msgstr ""

